# Everything the build does not read. The build context is sent to the daemon
# in full, so a stray data/ directory with a CA key in it would otherwise be
# shipped to it.
#
# 构建不读取的一切。构建上下文会被整个发送给 daemon，因此一个混在里面、装着 CA 私钥的
# data/ 目录，否则就会被一并送过去。
.git
.github
data
deploy/certs
*.md
**/testdata
**/*_test.go
